     Wait, `merge` tag doesn't have a fixed parent, so we should probably skip it or handle it carefully. The real lint check probably skips `merge` or `<include>` or unknown parents.
     Also, custom views extending these layouts would inherit their params. To keep it simple and robust, I'll check if the parent tag name ends with one of the known layout names, or just match exactly. I'll stick to exact match or `endsWith` for simplicity, but exact is safer. I'll also handle `androidx.constraintlayout.widget.ConstraintLayout` etc. by extracting the simple class name.

